{"version":"6.9","hitCount":1,"request":{"queryString":"PMCID:PMC7312096","internalQuery":"PMCID:PMC7312096","resultType":"CORE","cursorMark":"*","pageSize":1,"sort":"","synonym":false},"resultList":{"result":[{"id":"32471128","source":"MED","pmid":"32471128","pmcid":"PMC7312096","fullTextIdList":{"fullTextId":["PMC7312096"]},"doi":"10.3390/ijms21113784","title":"Aptamer Cocktail to Detect Multiple Species of Mycoplasma in Cell Culture.","authorString":"Wan Q, Liu X, Zeng Z, Chen Z, Liu Y, Zu Y.","authorList":{"author":[{"fullName":"Wan Q","lastName":"Wan","firstName":"Quanyuan","initials":"Q","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0003-4227-1530"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Pathology and Genomic Medicine, Houston Methodist Hospital, 6565 Fannin Street, Houston, TX 77030, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Liu X","lastName":"Liu","firstName":"Xiaohui","initials":"X","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Pathology and Genomic Medicine, Houston Methodist Hospital, 6565 Fannin Street, Houston, TX 77030, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Zeng Z","lastName":"Zeng","firstName":"Zihua","initials":"Z","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Pathology and Genomic Medicine, Houston Methodist Hospital, 6565 Fannin Street, Houston, TX 77030, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Chen Z","lastName":"Chen","firstName":"Zhenghu","initials":"Z","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0003-0342-1233"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Pathology and Genomic Medicine, Houston Methodist Hospital, 6565 Fannin Street, Houston, TX 77030, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Liu Y","lastName":"Liu","firstName":"Yanting","initials":"Y","authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Pathology and Genomic Medicine, Houston Methodist Hospital, 6565 Fannin Street, Houston, TX 77030, USA."}]}},{"fullName":"Zu Y","lastName":"Zu","firstName":"Youli","initials":"Y","authorId":{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0001-8574-9974"},"authorAffiliationDetailsList":{"authorAffiliation":[{"affiliation":"Department of Pathology and Genomic Medicine, Houston Methodist Hospital, 6565 Fannin Street, Houston, TX 77030, USA."}]}}]},"authorIdList":{"authorId":[{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0001-8574-9974"},{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0002-4472-994X"},{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0003-0342-1233"},{"type":"ORCID","value":"0000-0003-4227-1530"}]},"dataLinksTagsList":{"dataLinkstag":["altmetrics","supporting_data"]},"journalInfo":{"issue":"11","volume":"21","journalIssueId":2959748,"dateOfPublication":"2020 May","monthOfPublication":5,"yearOfPublication":2020,"journal":{"medlineAbbreviation":"Int J Mol Sci","title":"International journal of molecular sciences","essn":"1422-0067","issn":"1422-0067","isoabbreviation":"Int J Mol Sci","nlmid":"101092791"},"printPublicationDate":"2020-05-01"},"pubYear":"2020","pageInfo":"E3784","abstractText":"Mycoplasma contamination of cell line cultures is a common, yet often undetected problem in research laboratories. Many of the existing techniques to detect mycoplasma contamination of cultured cells are time-consuming, expensive, and have significant drawbacks. Here, we describe a mycoplasma detection system that is useful for detecting multiple species of mycoplasma in infected cell lines. The system contains three dye-labeled detection aptamers that can specifically bind to mycoplasma-infected cells and a dye-labeled control aptamer that minimally binds to cells. With this system, mycoplasma-contaminated cells can be detected within 30 min by using a flow cytometer, fluorescence microscope, or microplate reader. Further, this system may be used to detect mycoplasma-contaminated culture medium. This study presents an novel mycoplasma detection model that is simple, rapid, inexpensive, and sensitive.","affiliation":"Department of Pathology and Genomic Medicine, Houston Methodist Hospital, 6565 Fannin Street, Houston, TX 77030, USA.","publicationStatus":"epublish","language":"eng","pubModel":"Electronic","pubTypeList":{"pubType":["research-article","Journal Article"]},"grantsList":{"grant":[{"agency":"NCI NIH HHS","acronym":"CA","grantId":"R01 CA224304","orderIn":0}]},"meshHeadingList":{"meshHeading":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Cell Line, Tumor"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Humans"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Mycoplasma","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"N","abbreviation":"GE","qualifierName":"genetics"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"IP","qualifierName":"isolation & purification"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Culture Media"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Flow Cytometry"},{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","descriptorName":"Cell Culture Techniques"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Binding, Competitive"},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"Aptamers, Nucleotide","meshQualifierList":{"meshQualifier":[{"majorTopic_YN":"Y","abbreviation":"ME","qualifierName":"metabolism"}]}},{"majorTopic_YN":"N","descriptorName":"DNA Contamination"}]},"keywordList":{"keyword":["Cell culture","Mycoplasma","Rapid detection","Dna Aptamer"]},"chemicalList":{"chemical":[{"name":"Culture Media","registryNumber":"0"},{"name":"Aptamers, Nucleotide","registryNumber":"0"}]},"subsetList":{"subset":[{"code":"IM","name":"Index Medicus"}]},"fullTextUrlList":{"fullTextUrl":[{"availability":"Open access","availabilityCode":"OA","documentStyle":"pdf","site":"Unpaywall","url":"https://www.mdpi.com/1422-0067/21/11/3784/pdf"},{"availability":"Subscription required","availabilityCode":"S","documentStyle":"doi","site":"DOI","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/ijms21113784"},{"availability":"Open access","availabilityCode":"OA","documentStyle":"html","site":"Europe_PMC","url":"https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC7312096"},{"availability":"Open access","availabilityCode":"OA","documentStyle":"pdf","site